  "slug": "contract-formation-05-inspect",
  "title": "Exchange of promises — inspecting a receipt's time label and substituting it",
  "titleEs": "Intercambio de promesas — Inspección y cambio de un dato",
  "category": "contract-formation",
  "categoryName": "Formación del contrato",
  "motif": "Intercambio de promesas",
  "treatment": "inspect",
  "family": "focus-and-replay",
  "description": "The story's end state: A's commitment (●) in Party B's rack and B's commitment (◆) in Party A's rack, each card printing its holder, and the strip \"Sequence as supplied (illustrative)\". A lens enlarges the strip's record of the receipts — each commitment received by the other party (a real copy of the scene, ≥ 1.5×); the inspected event's fictional time label (by default the receipt of B's commitment) is struck, then turns over in the scene and returns with the supplied alternative label. The stations keep the supplied order and the cards keep their racks and holders. The lens closes onto the identical stations; a Δ marks the changed label and the struck old value stays readable. \"Reciprocal\" and \"unilateral\" are supplied configurations only; nothing is concluded.",
